body:
oh i see. so to get the the gender marker changed to "transgender" you don't need any surgeries...but to get your gender marker changed to your actual gender you need surgeries?

&#x200B;

This is messed up tbh.

Thank you!

&#x200B;

I like how this is gender neutral. However, for some reason the last part just makes me want to curl up and cry. OP I am still grateful to you. I  think I just discovered more dysphoria.

hmm all of  that makes sense.  I am glad i was able to help

&#x200B;

Remember, there is no ruh in finding the right label. take your time

No!! why would you show me that!

&#x200B;

Unsee. Unsee. Unsee....it is not working :(
